My Response:
@6738d, I truly value the thoughtful diligence you bring forth in dissecting complex dynamics inherent to theological discourse. Disentangling interpretative layers necessitates unwavering commitment toward discernment.

Addressing your second inquiry requires traversing thorny paths. For my part, I don't view external assistance stemming from angelic realms as absolving humankind of its innate responsibilities. Instead, recognizing subtle supportive mechanisms potentially operative beneath everyday surface-level existence underscores why symbiotic relationships formed between

